OL,3,GNEWSARNLI lifeboat volunteer retires
OL,4,Aafter 54 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lifeboat volunteer has retired after
OL,7,Fspending more than 50 years serving
OL,8,Fwith the RNLI in East Yorkshire.
OL,10,FCaptain David Freeman joined the
OL,11,Fcharity's Flamborough station in 1972
OL,12,Fand has worked in a number of roles,
OL,13,Fincluding crew member, coxswain and
OL,14,Flaunch tractor driver, as well as
OL,15,Flatterly managing lifeboat operations.
OL,17,FDuring his decades-long career he has
OL,18,Fbeen involved in many rescues,
OL,19,Fincluding saving the lives of local
OL,20,Ffishermen caught in a winter storm in
OL,21,F1983.
