OL,3,GNEWSARNLI lifeboat volunteer retires
OL,4,Aafter 54 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FFreeman said: "The RNLI has been a huge
OL,7,Fpart of my life and I have met so many
OL,8,Fgreat people through the station."
